{"product_id":"uwell-caliburn-g5-koko-35w-pod-system","title":"Uwell Caliburn G5 Koko 35W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Uwell Caliburn G5 KOKO Pod Kit is a new compact and stylish pod system utilizing the latest Caliburn GPP Pods. Integrated with a 1600mAh rechargeable battery for long-lasting vaping, the Caliburn G5 KOKO is constructed of durable zinc alloy and premium leather, adopt a draw or button activated firing system with dual output modes to deliver up to 35W, is also equipped with a starlit ocean display screen.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003e\u003ca title=\"Caliburn GPP Pods\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/caliburn-gpp-replacement-pods\"\u003eUwell Caliburn GPP Pods\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUwell Caliburn G5 KOKO Pod Kit Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions: 84 x 49 x 21mm\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output: Max 35W\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBattery Capacity: 1600mAh\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOutput Mode: Storm \/ Waves\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFiring System: Draw Activated\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChassis Construction: Zinc Alloy, Leather\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCharging Port: Type-C\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Compatibility: Caliburn GPP Pods, Caliburn G3 Pods\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Capacity: 3.0ml\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFilling System: Side Fill\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAirflow System: Adjustable Top Airflow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Connection: Magnetic\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePod Material: PCTG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePro-FOCS 4.0 Flavor Technology\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLanyard Attachment Point\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePack